<Layout title="About us">
  <section class="wrap prose">
    <h1 class="page">About Dhaga Studio</h1>
    <p>Dhaga Studio started in 2019 as a two-loom workshop in a lane near Johari Bazaar in Jaipur. Friends kept asking us to post scarves to relatives in other cities, so we did, wrapped in muslin with a handwritten note.</p>
    <p>Today we ship across India from the same studio. We work directly with weaving clusters in Bagru, Kutch, Pochampally and Srinagar, and keep a small, carefully chosen list: everyday cotton, festival silks and warm winter wraps.</p>
    <p>Every order is packed by hand within a day. If something arrives damaged, send us a photo and we'll replace it.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
